Regional Market Insights
•	Asia-Pacific: Dominates global demand, accounting for over 45% of market share. China remains both the largest producer and consumer, while India shows the fastest growth at 8.2% CAGR.
•	North America: Characterized by high replacement demand for smart, connected appliances with energy-saving features. The U.S. accounts for nearly 80% of regional sales.
•	Europe: Strict energy efficiency regulations shape product offerings, with Western Europe maintaining steady demand for eco-friendly refrigerators and washing machines.
•	Latin America: Brazil leads the region, though economic volatility affects spending patterns. Budget-friendly models tailored to local conditions perform well.
•	Middle East & Africa: Gulf countries show preference for premium appliances, while Africa presents long-term growth potential as urbanization increases.
